{"seq":3,"slug":"sleep-and-health","title":"睡眠与健康","docCount":3,"url":"/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-and-cognitive-function","title":"睡眠与认知功能","url":"/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-and-cognitive-function","wordCount":2091,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"sleep-metabolism-and-immunity","title":"睡眠、代谢与免疫","url":"/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-metabolism-and-immunity","wordCount":2055,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"sleep-disorders-overview","title":"睡眠障碍概览","url":"/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-disorders-overview","wordCount":1996,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 睡眠与健康\n\n本章聚焦睡眠质量和时长对人体各系统的广泛影响——从大脑认知到代谢免疫，再到临床睡眠障碍。\n\n## 内容概要\n\n- **睡眠与认知功能**：睡眠如何影响记忆巩固、注意力、决策能力和创造性思维\n- **睡眠、代谢与免疫**：睡眠不足对胰岛素敏感性、食欲激素、免疫细胞活性的损害机制\n- **睡眠障碍概览**：失眠症、阻塞性睡眠呼吸暂停、不宁腿综合征等常见疾病的识别与分类\n\n理解睡眠的健康维度，能为后续学习睡眠优化策略提供充分的动机与科学依据。\n"}